## Flags for guiltty's VM: https://www.erlang.org/doc/man/erl.html
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie are configured via env vars, do not set them here

## Distribution listens on 127.0.0.1 only: nothing on the network can
## reach the node, with or without the cookie (book chapter 20).
-kernel inet_dist_use_interface {127,0,0,1}
